  otherwise it is an empty tensor.
- `singular_values`: tensor of singular values of the matrices in :attr:`A`.
  It has shape `(*, min(m, n))`.
  It is computed when :attr:`driver` is one of (`'gelsd'`, `'gelss'`),
  otherwise it is an empty tensor.

.. note::
